Follow up: Recursive solution is trivial, could you do it iteratively?', 0, 1, 6.9, N'/problems/binary-tree-preorder-traversal', N'619.4K', N'1100K');
INSERT INTO Leetcode.Question (id, title, description, isPremium, difficultyId, frequency, questionSlug, numberOfAcceptedSubmissions, numberOfSubmissions) VALUES (145, N'Binary Tree Postorder Traversal', N'Given the `root` of a binary tree, return the postorder traversal of its nodes'' values.


